
# <type>(<scope>): <subject, imperative, under 60 chars>
#
# What:
# - concrete changes, one bullet each
#
# Why:
# - the reason, citing SPEC or ARCHITECTURE section where relevant
#
# Verified:
# - what you ran and what it reported
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Types:  feat  fix  perf  refactor  test  docs  chore  style
# Scopes: engine  metrics  storage  adaptive  test-surface  results  progress
#         ui  perf  setup
#
# Verified: is not optional. If nothing was run, write
#   Verified: not yet covered by tests
# so the gap is visible in the log rather than implied.
#
# Never commit with a subject like "updates", "wip", "fixes" or "changes".
# One commit per logical unit of work. It should be revertable on its own.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
